{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outthink. Outlast. Outplay.</strong><br><br>Step into a tactical roguelike where every battle is a puzzle, every move matters, and defeat is just the start of the story! Assemble your team of unique idiots and fight through 4 dangerous regions \u2014 each with its own enemies, gimmicks, and secrets... From goblin ambushes in dense forests to mind-bending traps in a forgotten library, every encounter forces you to adapt your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Chess with Idiots is a turn based strategy roguelike. You control a self made team of 'Idiots' with the goal of completing as many runs as possible. A run starts at the forest and ends at the final boss on top of the volcano. Finishing a run allows you to either continue, or completely end your run. If you decide to continue, you restart at the forest but will notice that all the enemies have become a lot stronger...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom turn order -</strong> Determine the order of actions yourself and create the optimal strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.poster.avif?t=1759264390\" width=402 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.webm?t=1759264390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.mp4?t=1759264390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Regions</strong> \u2013 Forest, Cave, Library, and Volcano \u2014 each with unique visuals, challenges, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/e7c8867f6ad35f863b3f01ecd0e11c28.avif?t=1759264390\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong> \u2013 Unlock new characters, abilities, and strategies with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/47584f573f7163191b6f13dcfebcce5d.avif?t=1759264390\" data-has-big width=1560 height=879 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong> \u2013 No two battles play out the same thanks to randomized enemy setups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Hazards</strong> \u2013 Lava flows, collapsing tiles, magical anomalies, and more keep the battlefield alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.poster.avif?t=1759264390\" width=188 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.webm?t=1759264390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.mp4?t=1759264390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted\u00a02D Art &amp; Effects</strong> \u2013 Colorful environments and smooth animations bring each region to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you conquer the dragon at the heart of the volcano\u2026 or become just another hero swallowed by the flames?</strong></i><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>! This game is not a variant of chess, it is it's own concept but influenced by the game of chess.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946970?t=1759264390","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946970?t=1759264390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/b33b1bb680cf4a5a79b611f915bbd2edccf95a51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759264390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/b33b1bb680cf4a5a79b611f915bbd2edccf95a51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759264390","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4040860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outthink. Outlast. Outplay.</strong><br><br>Step into a tactical roguelike where every battle is a puzzle, every move matters, and defeat is just the start of the story! Assemble your team of unique idiots and fight through 4 dangerous regions \u2014 each with its own enemies, gimmicks, and secrets... From goblin ambushes in dense forests to mind-bending traps in a forgotten library, every encounter forces you to adapt your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Chess with Idiots is a turn based strategy roguelike. You control a self made team of 'Idiots' with the goal of completing as many runs as possible. A run starts at the forest and ends at the final boss on top of the volcano. Finishing a run allows you to either continue, or completely end your run. If you decide to continue, you restart at the forest but will notice that all the enemies have become a lot stronger...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom turn order -</strong> Determine the order of actions yourself and create the optimal strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.poster.avif?t=1759264390\" width=402 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.webm?t=1759264390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.mp4?t=1759264390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Regions</strong> \u2013 Forest, Cave, Library, and Volcano \u2014 each with unique visuals, challenges, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/e7c8867f6ad35f863b3f01ecd0e11c28.avif?t=1759264390\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong> \u2013 Unlock new characters, abilities, and strategies with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/47584f573f7163191b6f13dcfebcce5d.avif?t=1759264390\" data-has-big width=1560 height=879 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong> \u2013 No two battles play out the same thanks to randomized enemy setups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Hazards</strong> \u2013 Lava flows, collapsing tiles, magical anomalies, and more keep the battlefield alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.poster.avif?t=1759264390\" width=188 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.webm?t=1759264390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.mp4?t=1759264390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted\u00a02D Art &amp; Effects</strong> \u2013 Colorful environments and smooth animations bring each region to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you conquer the dragon at the heart of the volcano\u2026 or become just another hero swallowed by the flames?</strong></i><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>! This game is not a variant of chess, it is it's own concept but influenced by the game of chess.</p>","developers":["Skeletons With Jobs"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/0b7c791068fcdd58daa293611953e30257dcb36c/header.jpg?t=1759264390","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.a